  "body": "Some platforms don't support Bluetooth LE at all. Others support it conditionally depending on whether a radio is attached. [`getAvailability()`](https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/#availability) covers the second group of platforms, and can be used to cover the first, but it might be simpler for developers to be able to treat no-Bluetooth platforms they same as they treat no-Bluetooth browsers.\n\nhttps://github.com/WICG/web-share/pull/8 and https://github.com/whatwg/notifications/issues/81 propose this strategy for two other specs.\n\n@slightlyoff @PaulKinlan @RByers\n",
